<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Sofamor, Silicon.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Sofamor, Silicon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday Sofamor Danek Group Inc, Silicon Graphics Inc, Grand Casinos Inc and American Medical Response Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading for news pending.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock WCX were also unavailable for trading.</p>
</text>
